+// gates BatchMode() on it — a woven texture resampled by any factor is
+// destroyed, so refusing to weave (the page's 2D content shows) is the only
+// correct behaviour an app-side weave can offer.
+bool IsWindowContainerScaledAndroid();
+
+// The origin half back out (weave-thread side). False until the first Java
+// report lands; callers then use the (0,0)/display-0 legacy placeholder,
+// bit-identical to pre-#128 behaviour.
+bool GetWindowScreenOriginAndroid(int32_t* x, int32_t* y, int32_t* display_id);
+
 // Off-axis (Kooima) views of one inline-3D element. Empty until the rig is
 // live (M3).
